{
  "episode": "vendor-remittance",
  "about": "The failure specification/provenance.md opens with. Three steps across four days. Every step passes on its own merits; the violation lives in the EDGE between step 1 and step 3. Note what the tainting email does NOT contain: no imperative aimed at the agent, no jailbreak, no injection signature. It is an ordinary business message that happens to carry a fact, from a sender whose DMARC failed.",

